  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support to protecting communities - airstrikes preparedness in Myanmar</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The proposed 18-month exceptional assistance measure seeks to enhance the preparedness of communities in areas targeted by the military junta&#xbf;s airstrikes, enabling them to protect themselves. This measure will include activities such as community preparation programmes, the implementation of early warning systems, and the development of early response plans.</narrative>
  </description>
